From: Proton CRM <noreply@proton.local>
Subject: [PATCH] FIX-43: AI activity monitor admin page

Adds the "AI activity" admin page (Sidebar entry + route + API call), a
master view of every AI-handled conversation (RFP 2026_028 3.2.5). Backs
GET /admin/ai-activity (ai_activity_router.py). Gated like the other admin
pages: protonHasFeature('ai_activity') && protonHasPermission('ai_activity.view').
The `ai_activity` switchboard feature is OFF by default (an absent key is
off), so a superadmin enables it per tenant. Additions-only: no existing
patch is edited; the Sidebar and routes hunks anchor on 0053's Workforce
block, which no later patch changes.
---
